#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:2
msgid "Share Access Control"
msgstr "Share Access Control"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:7
msgid ""
"Share Access controls allow administrators to manage host-level access "
"rules for File Shares associated with storage servers. Access rules "
"define which hosts or IP addresses can connect to a file share and what "
"level of access they are granted (e.g., read-only, read/write)."
msgstr ""
"Share Acceso controls permitir administrators a manage host-nivel acceso "
"reglas para Archivo Shares asociado con storage servidores. Acceso reglas"
" define cual hosts o IP direcciones puede connect a un archivo share y "
"qué nivel de acceso they son granted (e.g., read-solo, read/write)."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:9
msgid ""
"Share Access rules are specific to File Shares that are backed by a "
"Storage Server integration (such as Dell EMC Isilon or other NAS "
"platforms). The available access rule options are determined by the "
"storage server type."
msgstr ""
"Share Acceso reglas son específico a Archivo Shares ese son backed por un"
" Almacenamiento Servidor integration (como Dell EMC Isilon o otro NAS "
"platforms). El disponible acceso regla opciones son determined por el "
"storage servidor tipo."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:12
msgid "Role Requirements"
msgstr "Role Requirements"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:14
msgid ""
"``Infrastructure: Storage`` role permission at **Full** level is required"
" to create, edit, or delete access rules."
msgstr ""
"``Infrastructure: Storage`` permiso de rol en **Full** nivel es requerido"
" a crear, editar, o eliminar acceso reglas."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:15
msgid ""
"``Infrastructure: Storage`` role permission at **Read** level allows "
"viewing access rules only."
msgstr ""
"``Infrastructure: Storage`` permiso de rol en **Read** nivel permite "
"viewing acceso reglas solo."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:18
msgid "Viewing Share Access Rules"
msgstr "Viewing Share Access Rules"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:20
#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:30
msgid "Navigate to ``Infrastructure > Storage``"
msgstr "Navegue un ``Infrastructure > Storage``"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:21
#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:31
msgid "Select the **FILE SHARES** tab"
msgstr "Seleccionar el **FILE SHARES** pestaña"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:22
msgid "Click the name of the File Share to view its detail page"
msgstr "Click el nombre del Archivo Share a ver su página de detalles"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:23
#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:33
#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:56
#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:65
msgid "Select the **ACCESS** tab"
msgstr "Seleccionar el **ACCESS** pestaña"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:25
msgid ""
"The Access tab displays all configured access rules for the file share, "
"including the rule name, access level, and associated host or IP address."
msgstr ""
"El Acceso pestaña muestra todos configurado acceso reglas para el archivo"
" share, incluyendo el regla nombre, nivel de acceso, y associated host o "
"IP dirección."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:28
msgid "Adding an Access Rule"
msgstr "Adding un Acceso Rule"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:32
msgid "Click the name of the File Share"
msgstr "Click el nombre del Archivo Share"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:34
msgid "Click :guilabel:`+ ADD`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`+ AGREGAR`"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:35
msgid "Fill in the required fields:"
msgstr "Fill en el requerido campos:"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:37
msgid "NAME"
msgstr "NAME"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:38
msgid "A descriptive name for the access rule."
msgstr "Un descriptive nombre para el acceso regla."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:39
msgid "HOST / IP"
msgstr "HOST / IP"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:40
msgid ""
"The host name or IP address to grant access to. The available fields "
"depend on the storage server type."
msgstr ""
"El host nombre o IP dirección a grant acceso a. El disponible campos "
"depend en el storage servidor tipo."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:41
msgid "ACCESS LEVEL"
msgstr "ACCESS LEVEL"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:42
msgid ""
"The level of access to grant to the host. Options depend on the storage "
"provider and may include:"
msgstr ""
"El nivel de acceso a grant al host. Opciones depend en el storage "
"provider y puede incluir:"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:44
msgid "**Read Only** — The host can read data from the share but cannot write."
msgstr "**Read Only** — El host puede read datos desde el share pero cannot write."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:45
msgid "**Read/Write** — The host can both read and write data to the share."
msgstr "**Read/Write** — El host puede ambos read y write datos al share."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:46
msgid ""
"**Root** — The host has full root-level access (where supported by the "
"provider)."
msgstr ""
"**Root** — El host tiene completo root-nivel acceso (donde soportado por "
"el provider)."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:48
msgid "Note"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:48
msgid ""
"Additional configuration fields may appear depending on the underlying "
"storage server type. These are defined by the provider's share access "
"option types."
msgstr ""
"Adicional configuración campos puede aparecer dependiendo de el "
"underlying storage servidor tipo. Estos son definido por el provider's "
"share acceso opción tipos."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:50
#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:59
msgid "Click :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`GUARDAR CAMBIOS`"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:53
msgid "Editing an Access Rule"
msgstr "Editing un Acceso Rule"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:55
#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:64
msgid "Navigate to the File Share detail page"
msgstr "Navegue un el Archivo Share detail página"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:57
msgid "Click the edit icon (pencil) next to the access rule"
msgstr "Click el editar ícono (pencil) siguiente al acceso regla"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:58
msgid "Modify the desired fields"
msgstr "Modify el desired campos"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:62
msgid "Deleting an Access Rule"
msgstr "Deleting un Acceso Rule"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:66
msgid "Click the delete icon (trash) next to the access rule"
msgstr "Click el eliminar ícono (trash) siguiente al acceso regla"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:67
msgid "Confirm the deletion"
msgstr "Confirmar el deletion"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:69
msgid "Warning"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:69
msgid ""
"Removing an access rule immediately revokes the host's ability to connect"
" to the file share. Ensure no active workloads depend on the access "
"before removing."
msgstr ""
"Removing un acceso regla immediately revokes el host's ability a connect "
"al archivo share. Asegurar no activo cargas de trabajo depend en el "
"acceso antes de removing."

